// Back-compat fixture — deliberately exercises the LEGACY spellings that
// decision #48 superseded, so the aliases keep parsing. Every other fixture
// in this directory demonstrates the CANONICAL form. Do not "modernize" this
// file: `start` (canonical `start-date`) and the bare `s` sprint suffix
// (canonical `sp`) are load-bearing here.
gantt Legacy Syntax Back-Compat
start 2026-03-01
sprint-length 2w
sprint-number 3
sprint-start 2026-02-02

[Crew]
  Scout Harbors 2s
  Plot Course 1s
  Provision Hold 0.5s
  Set Sail 0d
